msgid "WEAPON_1026_NAME"
msgstr "God Striking Whip"

#. weapon.csv: The zither sound is demonic, disturbing the mind.
msgid "WEAPON_1027_DESC"
msgstr "The zither sound is demonic, disturbing the mind."

#. weapon.csv: Heavenly Demonic Zither
msgid "WEAPON_1027_NAME"
msgstr "Heavenly Demonic Zither"

#. weapon.csv: The sound of the flute is shrill and can contro...
msgid "WEAPON_1028_DESC"
msgstr ""
"The sound of the flute is shrill and can control corpses, making people turn"
" pale at the sound."

#. weapon.csv: Spirit Controlling Flute
msgid "WEAPON_1028_NAME"
msgstr "Spirit Controlling Flute"

#. weapon.csv: Fine as a cow's hair, coming and going without ...
msgid "WEAPON_1029_DESC"
msgstr ""
