"intent and cannot be used by those with weak will."

#. weapon.csv: Bloodthirsty Saber
msgid "WEAPON_1031_NAME"
msgstr "Bloodthirsty Saber"

#. weapon.csv: Cast from extraterrestrial meteoric iron. The h...
msgid "WEAPON_1032_DESC"
msgstr ""
