" but great skill requires no workmanship. It can break all techniques with "
"force."

#. weapon.csv: Meteor Heavy Sword
msgid "WEAPON_1032_NAME"
msgstr "Meteor Heavy Sword"

#. weapon.csv: The sword is as soft as silk, but when infused ...
msgid "WEAPON_1033_DESC"
msgstr ""
"The sword is as soft as silk, but when infused with spiritual energy, it "
"moves like a spirit snake, strange and unpredictable."

#. weapon.csv: Spirit Snake Soft Sword
msgid "WEAPON_1033_NAME"
msgstr "Spirit Snake Soft Sword"

#. weapon.csv: A standard weapon of the Zhenhun Sect, combinin...
msgid "WEAPON_1034_DESC"
msgstr ""
"A standard weapon of the Zhenhun Sect, combining water and fire to trap "
"enemies and lock souls."

#. weapon.csv: Water and Fire Dragon Capturing Staff
msgid "WEAPON_1034_NAME"
msgstr "Water and Fire Dragon Capturing Staff"

#. weapon.csv: A set of flying swords refined from Heavenly Th...
msgid "WEAPON_1051_DESC"
msgstr ""
"A set of flying swords refined from Heavenly Thunder Bamboo, containing the "
"Evil-Warding Divine Thunder to suppress all evil in the world."

#. weapon.csv: Heavenly Thunder Bamboo Sword
msgid "WEAPON_1051_NAME"
msgstr "Heavenly Thunder Bamboo Sword"

#. weapon.csv: The weapon of the Six-Eared Macaque, changing a...
msgid "WEAPON_1052_DESC"
msgstr ""
"The weapon of the Six-Eared Macaque, changing as desired, as large or small "
"as one wishes."

#. weapon.csv: As-You-Will Iron Rod
msgid "WEAPON_1052_NAME"
msgstr "As-You-Will Iron Rod"

#. weapon.csv: The fan surface features five fires including a...
msgid "WEAPON_1053_DESC"
msgstr ""
"The fan surface features five fires including air fire, stone fire, and wood"
" fire, turning things to ashes in one wave."

#. weapon.csv: Five Fires Seven Poultry Fan
msgid "WEAPON_1053_NAME"
msgstr "Five Fires Seven Poultry Fan"

#. weapon.csv: Surging killing intent, once stained with the b...
msgid "WEAPON_1054_DESC"
msgstr ""
"Surging killing intent, once stained with the blood of demon gods; the spear"
" never returns once thrown."

#. weapon.csv: God Killer Spear
msgid "WEAPON_1054_NAME"
msgstr "God Killer Spear"

#. weapon.csv: Crimson throughout, with overwhelming fighting ...
msgid "WEAPON_1055_DESC"
msgstr ""
"Crimson throughout, with overwhelming fighting spirit. It has been stained "
"with the blood of countless strong men, and the spear strikes without "
"regret."

#. weapon.csv: Crimson Blood War Spear
msgid "WEAPON_1055_NAME"
msgstr "Crimson Blood War Spear"

#. weapon.csv: A trace of light hidden in a red gourd, with ey...
msgid "WEAPON_1056_DESC"
msgstr ""
"A trace of light hidden in a red gourd, with eyebrows and eyes. Please turn "
"around, treasure, for gods and ghosts cannot escape."

#. weapon.csv: Immortal Slaying Flying Dagger
msgid "WEAPON_1056_NAME"
msgstr "Immortal Slaying Flying Dagger"

#. weapon.csv: Neither copper, iron, nor steel, once hidden un...
msgid "WEAPON_1057_DESC"
msgstr ""
"Neither copper, iron, nor steel, once hidden under Mount Sumeru. Sharp qi "
"pierces directly into the nine heavens."

#. weapon.csv: Immortal Slaying Sword
msgid "WEAPON_1057_NAME"
msgstr "Immortal Slaying Sword"

#. weapon.csv: Swords of true love, one female and one male, k...
msgid "WEAPON_1058_DESC"
msgstr ""
"Swords of true love, one female and one male, killing when separated, "
"amorous when together."

#. weapon.csv: Gan Jiang and Mo Ye
msgid "WEAPON_1058_NAME"
msgstr "Gan Jiang and Mo Ye"

#. weapon.csv: Essence leaf of Taiyin; one wave stops fire, tw...
msgid "WEAPON_1059_DESC"
msgstr ""
"Essence leaf of Taiyin; one wave stops fire, two waves create wind, three "
"waves bring rain."

#. weapon.csv: Plantain Fan
msgid "WEAPON_1059_NAME"
msgstr "Plantain Fan"

#. weapon.csv: Wei Hu's weapon; although light and agile, it h...
msgid "WEAPON_1060_DESC"
msgstr ""
"Wei Hu's weapon; although light and agile, it hits with the weight of Mount "
"Tai."

