msgid "WEAPON_1062_DESC"
msgstr ""
"Made entirely of ten-thousand-year-old cold iron, the spear body is silvery "
"white and bone-chilling to the touch."

#. weapon.csv: Cold Iron Silver Spear
msgid "WEAPON_1062_NAME"
msgstr "Cold Iron Silver Spear"

#. weapon.csv: Harvested from the Purple Bamboo Forest in the ...
msgid "WEAPON_1063_DESC"
msgstr ""
"Harvested from the Purple Bamboo Forest in the South Sea, it has seven "
"sections and is exceptionally tough. It can wound enemies and bind demons."

#. weapon.csv: Seven-Section Purple Bamboo Whip
msgid "WEAPON_1063_NAME"
msgstr "Seven-Section Purple Bamboo Whip"

#. weapon.csv: Carved from white jade, it produces the sound o...
msgid "WEAPON_1064_DESC"
msgstr ""
"Carved from white jade, it produces the sound of metal and stone when "
"played, cleansing inner demons."

#. weapon.csv: Jade Pipa
msgid "WEAPON_1064_NAME"
msgstr "Jade Pipa"

#. weapon.csv: Made of deep-sea cold jade. When played, it sou...
msgid "WEAPON_1065_DESC"
msgstr ""
"Made of deep-sea cold jade. When played, it sounds like a dragon chanting in"
" the ocean, shaking the surroundings."

#. weapon.csv: Ocean Dragon Flute
msgid "WEAPON_1065_NAME"
msgstr "Ocean Dragon Flute"

#. weapon.csv: An ancient ominous weapon sealing the fierce so...
msgid "WEAPON_1071_DESC"
msgstr ""
"An ancient ominous weapon sealing the fierce soul of a White Tiger. It must "
"drink blood when unsheathed and may backlash against its master."

#. weapon.csv: Fierce Tiger Evil Blade
msgid "WEAPON_1071_NAME"
msgstr "Fierce Tiger Evil Blade"

#. weapon.csv: Refined from fragments of pillars suspected to ...
